  "problem": "What is the system of equations represented by\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & -5 \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}11 \\\\ -7\\end{aligned}]?\n$$\n\nThe corresponding system of equations is\n\n| { | {{field-1}} | $=$ | $11$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| {{field-2}} | $=$ | $\\,\\,-7.$ |  |",
